<div id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7" class="abe-column-block" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="121380112" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;">
  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<p dir="ltr" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Dear AJRP Partners, </p>
<p dir="ltr" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We hope this message finds you well! We apologize for any inconvenience caused by our recent email system outage. If you reached out for assistance or had questions and didn’t receive a response, please know that we are still experiencing issues and are unable to receive or send communications. Feel free to call or text our program manager, Maggie Davis, at 614-400-6481 for assistance. We appreciate your understanding and patience!</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We are thrilled to invite you to our end-of-year ceremony to celebrate the achievements of our AJRP participants and acknowledge your incredible support!</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;">End-of-Year Ceremony Details</h3>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong>Tuesday, Aug. 6, 10 a.m.- noon</strong><br><strong>Linden Community Center<br>1350 Briarwood Ave., 43211</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">During the ceremony, we will have a keynote speaker, recognize some of our participants for their outstanding performance and bid farewell to our summer AJRP session.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;">Special Thank You for Partnership Placement Sites</h3>
<p dir="ltr" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thanks to your support, we had 334 participants who benefited from the opportunities and guidance you and your team provided. From 9:15 to 10 a.m., we will provide light snacks and drinks as a token of our gratitude. Your contributions have been invaluable in making this program a success! Please RSVP using the link below to confirm your attendance. Also, please share this information with any of your staff who worked with the participants.</p>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #E41B2B; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#E41B2B"><a href="https://form.jotform.com/242116588951160?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">RSVP</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 1em 0 15px;">Thank you once again for your dedication and support of the AJRP program. We look forward to celebrating with you!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Best,</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">AJRP Team</p>
